Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}TEDLOCK: Chandler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}泰德拉克小姐，你今天好漂亮{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Miss Tedlock, you're looking lovely today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你袖子的长度搭起来很好看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}May I say that is a very flattering sleeve length on you?{\r}
