Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，卡斯力克先生 要你在下班前去他办公室{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, Mr. Costilick would like you to stop by his office at the end of the day.{\r}
