Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果是有关恶作剧的事 我跟那一点也没关系{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, listen, if this is about those prank memos, I had nothing to do with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟我无关，真的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Really, nothing at all. Really.{\r}
