Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿，各位！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, you guys. You guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德要来了 他说有个天大的消息{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Chandler's coming, and he says he has this incredible news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}所以等他到了，我们要假装…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So when he gets here, let's all act like, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:01:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey. GROUP: Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}算了，一定会很棒的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Never mind. But it was gonna be really good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What's going on? RACHEL: What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.10,0:02:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}今天还是照常的工作{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a typical day at work. I'm inputting my numbers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}而我老板告诉我{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and Big Al calls me into his office...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他要升我当报表监督{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and tells me he wants to make me processing supervisor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 那真是太好了 - 恭喜！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- That is great! - Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}于是我辞职了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So I quit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.99,0:02:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 为什么  - 为什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}BOTH: Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为什么 这只是个暂时性的工作{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why? This was supposed to be a temp job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}钱德，你在那工作5年了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, Chandler, you've been there for five years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道，但如果我接受升职{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I know, but if I took it this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那就表示我就是要干这行{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...it'd be like admitting that this is what I actually do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那有加薪吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So was it a lot more money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那不重要，我只是不想成为{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Doesn't matter. I just don't want to be one of those guys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那种加班到12点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...that's in his office until 12:00 at night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.47,0:02:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}担心周网量的人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}worrying about the WENUS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝周网量〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"The WENUS"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}每周预估网路用量系统 那是报表名词{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Weekly estimated net usage system. It's a processing term.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}喔，是这样啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, that WENUS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那你打算怎么办{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, what are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不知道自己有何打算{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know. That's the thing. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但在那公司我肯定想不出来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm not gonna figure it out working there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我有你能做的事！{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh! I have something you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我有个新按摩客户叫史提夫{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I have this new massage client. Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}总之，他要开一间餐厅{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Anyway, um, he's opening up a restaurant...{\r}
