Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.67,0:03:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨，我在这{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, hi there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我知道，你是厨师 我原先也是想到你{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yeah, I know. You're a chef, I know, and I thought of you first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但现在需要工作的是钱德，所以…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But, um, Chandler's the one who needs a job right now, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，我只是没有很多当厨师的经验{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, I just don't have a lot of chefing experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}除非那只是卖土司的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Unless it's an all-toast restaurant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 怎样  - 他要找什么厨师{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Yeah. Yeah. - Well, what kind of food is he looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他想做广泛的尝试，他想找个人{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}He wants to do something eclectic, so he's looking for someone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}为他设计整份菜单{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...who can, you know, create the entire menu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 哦，老天 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Oh, my God. - Yeah, I know.{\r}
